  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The companion beside your wallet",
    "overview": "A graphite workspace uses warm orange actions and ivory text to make wallet information clear and approachable. The user-authorized U-topia palette reference informs the color direction; an original shield wordmark, single-wallet composition and retained sage geometric robot give U-Guardian its own expression. This documents the implemented local code-led redesign, with no approved image comp or generated imagery.\n\nDark tonal layers and generous space frame exact quantities and plain-language explanations. The companion brings personality through a gentle float and written state-linked expressions. Dialogs focus chat and configuration on the same page, with restrained entrances and reduced-motion support.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Graphite surfaces, orange actions with dark text, and ivory reading text.",
      "Self-hosted Manrope with Thai system fallbacks.",
      "An original shield wordmark and retained sage CSS companion.",
      "Exact quantities, explicit states, expandable evidence and confirmation actions.",
      "Bounded dialogs with sticky controls and keyboard focus return."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Written State Rule",
        "body": "Pair operational colors and mascot expressions with readable state text.",
